        "created_at": "2017-02-11T04:38:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So, I just finished up a game vs. Apostate. &nbsp;The Argent Adept, Ra, Bunker, the Naturalist, and Haka faced him amidst the chemical vats of Pike Industrial Complex.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Now, the game's nearing the end, and Apostate is alone on the board. &nbsp;AA has struggled to set up this game, but he has an Inspiring Supertonic, and he's looking to grant a power use. &nbsp;Who should he grant power to?</p><p>Ra has his Staff,&nbsp;<span>Bunker has a Flak Cannon,&nbsp;</span><span>Naturalist is a Deadly Crocodile, and Haka is wielding Taiaha.</span></p>",
