        "id": 189687,
        "name": "Ameena",
        "username": "Ameena",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-02-13T13:55:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So, all those heroes can do three points of damage with their power uses (or four in Ra's case if he throws the Staff rather than using his base power). Flak Cannon, Crocodile, and Taiaha all deal three points of damage (since Crocodile buffs itself) - Taiaha hits two targets but that looks to be irrelevant here since it sounds like Apostate is the only non-hero target present. And all damage is being buffed by the vat so that'll be four points of damage, or five if Ra wants to throw his Staff.</p>",
        "post_number": 7,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:15:53.552Z",
