        "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-02-14T01:46:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Throwing Ra's Staff is actually suboptimal. &nbsp;You could deal 5 damage with the staff, and then on his next turn play Imbued Fire and deal 4 damage with his base power. &nbsp;Or you could deal 4 damage with his base power, and then play Imbued Fire and deal 6 damage with his staff.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I just found it amusing that I could have literally picked any of my other heroes to deal the power and the optimal power use would deal 4 damage.</p>",
